</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#4-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>4. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>核心在于找到一个最优的贪心策略，使得剩余字符数最大化。</li>\n<li>需要保证每次选择都是最优的，即尽可能多地消耗 <code>A</code>，同时保留最多的 <code>B</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 逐个遍历字符串，尝试匹配所有可能的 <code>A</code> 和 <code>B</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用贪心策略，优先选择最左边的 <code>A</code> 和最右边的 <code>B</code> 进行匹配，然后逐步缩小搜索范围。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 贪心算法，因为它可以在每一步都做出当前看来最优的选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>4.3 数学推导（如适用）</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>关键公式</strong>: 假设总字符数为 n，最大剩余字符数为 m。</li>\n<li><strong>正确性证明</strong>: 根据贪心策略，每次选择都是最优的，因此剩余字符数最多为 m。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度分析</strong>: O(n)，因为每个字符只处理一次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"5-代码详解\"><a href=\"#5-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 代码详解\"></a>5. 代码详解</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">s = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">l = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">r = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(s) - <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">removed = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">while</span> l &lt; r:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> l &lt; r <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> s[l] != <span class=\"string\">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        l += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> l &lt; r <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> s[r] != <span class=\"string\">&#x27;B&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        r -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> l &lt; r:          <span class=\"comment\"># 找到一对可以消除的</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        l += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        r -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        removed += <span class=\"number\">2</span>   <span class=\"comment\"># 消除了两个字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(s) - removed)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，因为每个字符只处理一次。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，用于存储字符串和变量。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 与简单的暴力解法相比，本解法的时间和空间效率更高。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12341","path":"api/tags/P12341.json"}]}